function detailStatValue(stat){const value=stat?.displayValue??stat?.value;if(value===undefined||value===null)return '';const text=String(value).trim(),key=String(stat?.name||'');if(!text)return '';if(key==='possessionPct'){const numeric=Number(text.replace(/%$/,''));return text.endsWith('%')||!Number.isFinite(numeric)?text:`${text}%`}if(MATCH_STAT_RATE_KEYS.has(key)){const numeric=Number(text.replace(/%$/,''));if(!Number.isFinite(numeric))return text;return `${Math.round(numeric<=1?numeric*100:numeric)}%`}return String(value)}
function fmt(date,options){return new Intl.DateTimeFormat(undefined,{...options,timeZone:'Asia/Yangon'}).format(date)}
function formatMatchDateTime(value,options){const date=new Date(value);return Number.isFinite(date.getTime())?new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-GB',{...options,timeZone:'Asia/Yangon'}).format(date):''}
